ames are negligible.\n\n20 frames of enemy movement → diff decreased maybe 5-15. Good.\n\nLet me just do this repeatedly. It's fine.\n\nLet me first get to the tree screen with full health.\n\nContinue: press Start.\n\nLet me do that.\n\nActually, wait — I want to reduce enemy damage so Link doesn't die. The tree screen has many Octoroks. Let me go back to the start screen instead and take damage from... there are no enemies on start.\n\nHmm, the tree screen had ~5 Octoroks. Let me go there and take one hit then RETREAT? Can't retreat easily.\n\nAlternatively, use the screen west of start? \n\nLet me just go to the tree screen, and with full health (3 hearts), one hit is fine; then I'll snapshot and diff.\n\nPlan:\n1. Continue (Start) → start screen full health.\n2. Walk east to tree screen.\n3. Immediately snapshot fa (before much damage).\n4. Play 20 frames, screenshot. If heart lost → snapshot fb, diff. Else repeat from step 3 (snapshot fa again).\n\nActually, at full health it takes ~6 hits to die; I have time.\n\nLet me proceed. Press Start to continue.\n\nHmm, the death menu: is the cursor still on CONTINUE? Yes. Press Start.\n\nLet me do play_input start 60, screenshot."}
