ybe the game uses OAM DMA and the tool reads before DMA). Hmm, but the game over menu's heart cursor was correctly found as a sprite. So list_sprites works.\n\nHmm, but on the overworld list_sprites showed Link (2 sprites) and one other. No heart/counter sprites. So counters are background.\n\nContradiction stands. Let me read the full nametable rows to settle it.\n\nLet me read_nametable x=0 y=2 width=32 height=5.\n\nI'll do it."}
